<section class="faqs-section section-{{ section.id }}" id="section-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="ghd--block--faq ghd--block">
    <h2 class="faqs-section__title font-proxima">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="ghd--details mw">
      <details open>
        <summary>
          <h3>Does Global Healing make its own supplements?</h3>
        </summary>
        Yes. Global Healing is one of the few retail supplement companies in the world that does not use contract
        manufacturers. We formulate, manufacture, bottle, package, and distribute 100% of our products.
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>
          <h3>Where are Global Healing supplements made?</h3>
        </summary>
        Global Healing supplements are made in independently-owned and operated facilities in Phoenix, Arizona, and
        Houston, Texas.
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>
          <h3>Are Global Healing supplements third-party tested?</h3>
        </summary>
        Yes, Global Healing partners with several third-party laboratories to verify ingredient identity, purity, and
        safety and final formula safety.
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>
          <h3>Are Global Healing supplements organic?</h3>
        </summary>
        Every plant-based ingredient and formula is certified organic by the USDA. Our manufacturing facilities in
        Phoenix and Houston are closely monitored by USDA Organic certifying agents to ensure we abide by organic
        manufacturing practices.
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="references-section section-{{ section.id }}" id="section-{{ section.id }}">
